  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Acp 401.04 Filing Date. An application for license renewal shall be filed no sooner than 60 days before and no later than the expiration date of the applicant's license.\n\nSource. #7081, eff 8-26-99; ss by #7872, eff 4-14-03; ss by #10004, INTERIM, eff 9-22-11, EXPIRED: 3-20-12\n\nNew. #10158, eff 6-27-12; ss by #13005, eff 3-19-20",
